---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/about_me.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/Project.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 31 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		My name is Kenny Sun!<br>
		I'm a senior Computer Science major with a minor in Business Administration at Clemson University.
		I am currently in my last semseter at Clemson University and over the past few years, my technical experience
		includes software development, cloud computing, and machine learning.
	</p>
	<p>
		While I was a Software Engineering Intern at Wells Fargo, I developed records-retention automation tools using
		Python, C#, .NET, SQL, and AI/LLM technologies, resulting in an estimated $5 million in soft savings.<br>
		I also have experience with front end development working for AgFirst Farm Credit Bank, machine learning research
		experince at the College of Staten Island, and have experience with AWS cloud computing.<br>
		At CUHackit 2025, my team and I won the “Most Innovative” award for StrikePhone, a mobile application that used
		computer vision and an AWS-based backend to detect strikes and balls during backyard baseball games.
	</p>

	<p>
		Outside of technology, I spend my time playing sports, cooking and baking, arts, and playing video games!<br>
		I'm a big fan of college football and especially love to play football, basketball, and volleyball. <br>
		If you're interested in what I cook and bake, you can find my favorite recipes on my <a href="/recipes">Recipes</a> page.<br>
		I'm a big fan of painting and am currently working on learning to play the piano.<br>
		In terms of video games, I enjoy playing a variety of games, but my right now I'm really into the competitive scene
		of Pokemon and Tetris.<br>
	</p>
</Layout>
